      "reference_audio": "/Volumes/T9/indicvoices_r_ne/audio/S4257751100369637_009829.wav",
      "reference_text": "जन्मसिद्ध अधिकारको निम्ति चाहिँ झुक्दै नझुक्नु भन्ने खालको",
      "reference_sha256": "6ed10838a90596e8775880ff7a3116342079317d98b9ec29fe1737eaeebe9e6b",
